WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.890
Someone once said...

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:53.550
There is multicolored uiro

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:56.290
that grows like kiwi...

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:58.860
Kiwiro!

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:04.330
There are fresh pearl onion quail's eggs...

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:07.500
Quairl Eggions!

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:11.370
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:16.640
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:20.510
Flashy Presentation!

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:23.520
Supreme Service with a Meal!

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.620
Thank you for the food!

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:32.630
Looks yummy, doesn't it?

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:35.400
Fresh, flat lemon-style salmon...

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.230
Salemon!

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:40.170
And chai-style pumpkin...

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.230
Pumpchaikin!

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.710
I can't get enough!

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:49.040
We've definitely harvested 
the flavors of autumn!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:55.750
And the leaves have changed color...

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.550
Why, it's Pochiko!

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:04.260
Oh, so it is!

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.690
A letter from Melk?

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:11.700
Let's see... "How are you?

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:15.600
I'm writing this because I have a favor 
to ask you, Toriko and Chef Komatsu.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:19.470
Right now, I'm making a knife 
for Chef Lulubu from Guts,

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:23.680
but I'm having trouble locating a certain 
ingredient that I need to finish it.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.480
Unless I can sharpen the knife 
with the skin of that ingredient,

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.050
I can't complete it.

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.050
If you have any information about 
this, could you pass it on?

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.750
I'd appreciate it.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:33.420
Yours truly, Melk"

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:43.030
That's a Diamond Fig Crystal!

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:47.030
The giant fruit of the Fig Crystal 
that only grows once every ten years!

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:49.600
It sparkles like a diamond

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.040
and is covered with a tough skin,

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.270
but the fig inside is said to 
possess the finest sweetness.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:04:00.040
It's an extremely rare ingredient, though.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.450
Can we do anything to help her?

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:04.920
That was a delicious report, wasn't it?

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.750
And now, a special announcement.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.390
The 50th Gourmet Service 
Tournament is coming soon!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.590
Won't you provide a little entertainment 
to go along with a fine meal?

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.790
This is sure to be a tournament to remember,

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.230
as the winner will receive

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.460
a rare ingredient grown 
in IGO's own garden...

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:23.070
a Diamond Fig Crystal!

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:26.570
The timing's too perfect!

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.950
Everyone's so enthusiastic!

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:42.920
Toriko! Chef Komatsu!

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:43.950
Melk!

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.020
Melk-san!

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:48.460
Thank you for telling me 
about this tournament.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:52.790
Let's definitely go home with 
that Diamond Fig Crystal!

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.530
We'll help you!

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:55.160
Yeah!

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:59.070
Pochiko isn't with you?

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.940
She's the same as always...

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.680
Animals are honest, aren't they?

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.480
I'm not good enough.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.950
Actually, the knife I was 
asked to make this time

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.950
has only ever been completed by my master.

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:23.420
If I succeed, maybe even 
Pochiko will accept me.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:30.530
Alright, everyone!

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:35.100
Let's start the traditional, historical 
Gourmet Service Tournament!

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:38.370
I, Tina, will be your emcee!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:39.410
Gourmet Service

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:43.610
is a showdown to see who can please 
guests the most with their hospitality!

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.950
Please add color to the meal 
with a gorgeous presentation.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:51.420
Any presentation is okay, as long 
as it employs this Fig Crystal.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:54.590
And the grand prize is a super big...

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:58.020
...Diamond Fig Crystal!

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:02.360
Now I'd like to introduce our judges.

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:05.730
IGO Bureau Chief Uumen Ueda!

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.800
I'm looking forward to 
service with an impact!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.770
The man with a miraculous tongue,

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:14.110
the Taste Master of the 
Gourmet 7, Apollo-san!

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:15.740
It's great to be here.

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:18.480
National Gourmet Treasure, Setsuno-sama!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:22.410
Call me "Setsunon". And I can't wait!

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.280
Each judge can dole out up to 100 points.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.150
Each time they hit the 
button in front of them,

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.290
one point is added.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:33.090
Then, the total number of points will 
be displayed on this giant screen.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:37.330
Alright, let's have our 
first contestant come out!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.930
Entry number one!

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:41.200
One of the Four Kings Gourmet Hunters, Sunny!

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.130
Sunny?!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.300
Sunny-san!

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.800
Y-You two are here, too?!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.590
Amazing!

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.590
Wonderful!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:44.890
Excellent!

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:47.330
It's art! Beautiful!

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:49.500
Sculpture, background music,

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:52.300
and an ingredient cut into this form.

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.540
Perfect harmony!

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:57.210
A presentation almost too 
beautiful to be believed.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.040
I'm moved myself!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.940
I'm gonna cry!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.510
Could he love himself any more?

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:05.210
Yeah, really...

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.120
Wonderful impact!

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.920
Marvelous!

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:14.790
I think we can expect to see 
an impressive score here!

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.130
5... 7... 2!

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:19.090
275 points!

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:26.230
Oh, dear! It looks like Setsunon's score 
was a little bit lower than the others.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:30.500
I would've liked this sculpture better 
if the hair was in a pompadour.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.710
That's how you decided?!

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:35.380
Please have a seat in the first chair!

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:40.880
With a high score like this from the get-go, 
will anyone be able to surpass it?!

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:42.850
Alright, let's go on to our next contestant!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.720
Our next contestant!

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.390
Our next contestant...?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:53.060
This role-playing costume is 
even better than last time's!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.630
I did it, huh?

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:59.770
What are you doing?!

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:01.670
That's the question we should be asking you!

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.070
What?!

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:05.070
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:09.380
Cut it out! Quit messin' 
with my show or else!

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.380
It says... "irrelevant"!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.050
Then let's get back on track 
with our next contestant.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:21.090
Entry number 2!

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:24.320
Chef Komatsu from Hotel Gourmet!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.890
I promise I'll win this for you, Melk-san!

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.800
Matsu, can you beat me?

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:47.010
Knead the Fig Crystal into flour...

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:01.060
It's getting bigger and bigger!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.160
Melk Knife!

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.430
Chef Komatsu!

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:17.540
He cut up the Fig Crystals 
to look like jewels!

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:25.580
Well, just what kind of 
pizza is going to emerge?!

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.750
I can't wait to see it!

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.260
Oh, my! It's a fruit pie!

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:36.660
It's a Fig Crystal pie!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:39.960
The sweet taste of this fruit becomes 
concentrated at high temperatures.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:44.030
By enveloping it in dough, it's possible 
to bring out the flavor to the max!

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.370
So it's pie!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.740
What a beautiful pie!

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:51.570
It's like a pie treasure 
chest full of jewels!

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:52.940
Attaboy, Komatsu!

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:54.280
That's Chef Komatsu for you.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.150
I think we can expect to see 
another high score here!

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.520
Will it be higher than Sunny's?!

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:32.310
Huh?!

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:34.380
195 points!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.380
A surprisingly low score!

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.850
Mr. Apollo scored low!

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.850
What happened?!

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:42.390
Sorry about that.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.860
It looked great,

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:48.400
but I already had pie for my snack today.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:51.130
Too bad.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:56.570
Perhaps you should have found out what 
we judges ate beforehand, Chef Komatsu.

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:00.640
I'm a little relieved.

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:02.380
And now, our next contestant!

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.980
Cutler Melk the Second, come on down!

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:05.750
Melk, she said!

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:09.680
In the end, it's my responsibility to do 
something so I can complete that knife.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:09.680
Seriously? A cutler? Can she cook?

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:11.750
Is someone like that gonna be okay?

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:12.850
Melk?

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:16.190
That's right!

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.190
This is Melk the Second,

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:21.230
successor to the world's best cutler, Melk!

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:24.560
What kind of service will she show us?!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.870
Crystal Petit Knife...

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:37.440
There's no knife that's better

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.040
at keeping the texture of a fruit intact.

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:47.290
Look at that! With that little knife...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.920
This is... beautiful.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:52.720
I take chopped Fig Crystal 
and vegetable gelatin,

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.490
mix it with soda water...

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:57.460
Oh my goodness! Is it a kind of fruit punch?!

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.510
Fantastic!

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:16.680
Wonderful!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.050
Beautiful!

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:20.750
Indeed!

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:30.460
Awesome!

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:33.030
It's like a mirror ball 
overflowing with fantasy!

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.600
Fig Crystal Punch!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.140
Let's find out the score!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.170
285 points!

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:44.040
Th-That's a heaping helping of awesome sauce!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.180
It's the highest score in the 
history of the tournament!

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.050
Please have a seat in the first chair!

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:53.780
Melk-san, you did it!

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:54.580
Yeah!

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.050
You're a shoo-in to win!

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:04.460
Knocking Master Jiro?!

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:09.500
I smell a Diamond Fig Crystal...

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:14.440
Dry it out and it'll make 
a great drinking snack.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.810
You're amazing, Jiro-chan!

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:23.610
Oh, my! Setsunon's already 
pushing her button!

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:22.240
I didn't expect him to show up...

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:25.810
Entry number four!

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:28.080
Knocking Master Jiro!

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:39.960
I pour plenty of booze on top

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.560
and flambé the whole thing!

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:48.600
Look at that!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:49.740
The flames...

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:50.810
A lion!

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:51.770
It's a lion!

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:56.040
This booze makes the flames 
dance into the form of a lion.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.050
Not the kind of drink you wanna buy somebody.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.550
It's dancing lion booze!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.160
What the hell is this?!

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:09.620
Wow!

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:12.790
This is incredible! Too mysterious!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:14.360
Nobody try this at home, okay?

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.300
Jiro-chan never disappoints!

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:21.340
I bet this also gets a super-high score!

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:26.540
Wow! Unbelievable! Look at that score!

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:28.910
295 points!

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:31.780
The record has been broken again!

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.810
Knocking Master Jiro!

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:36.550
The current top contestant!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:42.920
Alright, who's our next challenger?!

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.390
Entry number five!

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:49.900
Another one of the Four Kings 
Gourmet Hunters, Toriko!

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:53.970
Since it's come to this, I'll do somethin' 
about it one way or the other!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:55.900
Toriko-kun, huh?

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:57.540
My extra slab of marble...

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.510
What, is he gonna do a sculpture, too?!

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:00.640
I dunno...

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:01.840
Anyway, you're repulsive.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:04.110
Oh, really? You're just sayin' that!

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.320
Spiked Punch!

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.000
Awesome!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:29.000
How's that?! Marble slab fireworks!

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:34.040
I didn't know marble could sparkle like that!

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:37.040
That goes to show the tremendous 
power behind a Spiked Punch.

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:41.980
The crushed particles violently smashed 
against each other, creating fireworks!

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:45.080
Spiked Punch!

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:48.050
Spiked Punch!

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:54.190
Now that's a flashy presentation!

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:57.060
Will it set another record?!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.060
Alright! Get up there!

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:08.510
Huh? Wait, he didn't use 
the Fig Crystal, did he?!

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:14.410
Disqualified

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:15.650
Disqualified?!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.080
Whoops!

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:20.950
Is it all over?

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:26.720
And so, the winner

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:29.790
of this Gourmet Service 
Tournament is Knocking...

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:29.790
Hey, what's that?!

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:30.890
Hey!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:36.970
What the heck?! Pochiko?!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:38.200
Pochiko!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:38.800
Pochiko!

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:43.410
What's she doing?!

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:09.030
Getting worked up is producing 
incredible heat from her body.

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:25.010
This is luminescence!

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:26.550
Luminescence?

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:29.380
It's when a substance absorbs energy

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:32.420
from EM waves or heat and then reacts to it.

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:37.260
It's a phenomenon in which 
energy is released as light.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.860
Pochiko wants the ingredient so 
badly that she's literally fired up,

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:42.400
with her body releasing heat,

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:47.630
and the Diamond Fig Crystal 
emits light in reaction to it.

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:51.670
Pochiko!

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:55.640
This is the first time an impact 
like that has been made!

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.740
It's awe-inspiring!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:02.380
I would say the ingredient chose Pochiko.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.890
Th-There it is! A perfect score!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:11.020
The winner is Pochiko!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.030
Yes!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:24.440
The Diamond Fig Crystal goes 
to the winner, Pochiko!

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:26.070
Congratulations!

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:45.390
You're giving it to me...?

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:47.560
Melk-san...

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.040
Are you sure?

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:06.110
Pochiko! Thank you!

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:15.550
Toriko, Chef Komatsu...

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:17.120
Thank you for your help.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:20.060
I'm going to take the skin 
of the Diamond Fig Crystal.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:21.790
As for the fruit, split it up with 
everyone and eat it together.

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.490
Oh, thank you.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.530
Thank you!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.100
See you...

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:34.070
Pochiko accepted Melk long ago, didn't she?

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:35.770
Yes.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:39.040
She's always been watching over Melk-san.

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:41.810
The fruit of the Diamond Fig Crystal...

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.410
Oughta be good, right, Komatsu?

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.580
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.050
Huh? Sunny-san, you don't get any

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:51.450
After all, you lost.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.260
Y-Y-You lost, too!

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:55.190
That's true, isn't it?

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.060
That's right!

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:02.320
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:05.290
Okay, please choose one 
of these three platters.

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:09.230
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:12.400
Alright, here we go!

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:13.330
A heaping helping...

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:16.800
Open!

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:21.770
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:26.650
A - Stun Apple Capture Level 80

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:23.780
...yours if you chose A!

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:26.650
You'll be surprised how 
popular you're going to be.

00:22:26.650 --> 00:22:32.820
B - Stun Apple Capture Level 20

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:29.880
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:32.820
You may be a little surprised 
by how lucky you are with money.

00:22:32.820 --> 00:22:38.990
C - Stun Apple Capture Level 3

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.990
And I'm sorry. If you chose C, you're third.

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:38.990
You'll probably be surprised 
by just how boring the week is.

00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:42.460
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:39.390 --> 00:22:42.460
And now, the usual Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:44.460
Alright, here we go!

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:47.570
3... 2... 1...

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:49.430
Scoop chance!

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:50.470
Devote yourself...

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:52.640
...to this...

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:55.040
...every day!

00:22:56.980 --> 00:22:58.740
Always do your heaping helping best

00:22:58.740 --> 00:23:00.650
and become like Melk-san!

00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:03.380
I'm gonna devote myself to finding a scoop!

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:10.640
A Wall Penguin chick has gone missing in the woods near the Gourmet Shrine?

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:13.120
Komatsu-kun, hurry and find him!

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:16.990
Supreme Chitose Ame! Komatsu and Yun's Tale!

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:18.960
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
